{%- comment -%}
  pg-cart-zfix
  Cart drawer stacking fix.

  The drawer footer (.sticky-in-panel) is position:sticky at z-index 5.
  The orb offer card (#pg-unlock-slot .pg-offer) renders its ORB 1/2/3 and
  FREE ORB pickers as .pg-offer-pick at position:relative z-index 2, and on
  mobile Safari those select menus were painting through the footer, so the
  subtotal, shipping protection and total rows ended up underneath them.

  Fix: give the footer a clearly higher layer, and give every scrolling block
  in the drawer its own stacking context pinned below it, so nothing inside
  them can climb out. No media query needed, this applies on mobile and
  desktop alike.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} 2026-10 speed (css-layers): this file's CSS now lives in assets/pgs-cart.css (search its banner for this file name), linked from layout/theme.liquid between the header-group and overlay-group, which keeps the cascade order it had here. Edit it there. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  2026-11-03 CART PHOTOS: FLOATING SHOT ON PLAIN WHITE.
  Owner: "make sure cart photos are the floating w in the white background".

  Every console / hoodie / X50 variant image is already the transparent
  "floating" PNG (fl-*.png), so the cart line shows the right photo. What it
  sat on was pr.css's
    html body.pr-page aside#cart#cart#cart#cart ul.l4ca picture
      { background: var(--pr-panel) !important }   (#F5F3F9 lavender)
  which drew a lavender tile behind it. Five ids beat that rule's four, so the
  tile is now white and the product floats on the white drawer.

  On a phone the thumbnail box is 78x120, and object-fit:cover cut the sides
  off the wide consoles (R36H / R36H Ultra). Floating shots only (matched by
  the fl- file name) switch to contain, so the whole device shows; the white
  letterbox above and below is invisible on the white drawer. Square desktop
  boxes look the same either way. Orbs and accessories have no floating shot
  and keep cover, so their photos still fill the box.

  Kept here as inline CSS, not in pgs-cart.css, because that file is 203KB
  and this is a four-line override.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca > li > figure,
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca > li > figure picture{
    background:#fff !important;
  }
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca > li > figure img[src*="/files/fl-"]{
    object-fit:contain !important;
    background:#fff !important;
  }
</style>

